# Copy this file to `slack_webhook` in the same directory and replace the line
# below with the incoming-webhook URL from your Slack app
# (https://api.slack.com/apps -> Incoming Webhooks). The copied file is
# gitignored and mounted read-only into Alertmanager at
# /etc/alertmanager-secrets/slack_webhook.
#
# Write it without a trailing newline, e.g.:
#   printf '%s' 'https://hooks.slack.com/services/...' > infra/observability/secrets/slack_webhook
https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
